      constraints:['No Spark, Docker, Kubernetes or real scheduler/warehouse is required for this learning exercise.','Airflow owns orchestration/readiness; dbt owns SQL transformation lineage and data tests.','The final mart should support safe reruns/backfills without duplicating an order.','Retries are for transient operational failures, not deterministic bad business data.'],
      deliverables:['Airflow DAG dependency plan, including sensor/retry choices.','dbt folder/model plan with staging, intermediate and mart responsibilities.','Data-test plan covering keys, relationships, allowed tiers and SLA business quality.','Hybrid ownership map showing which Airflow task runs/tests which dbt scope.','A failure-policy explanation for late input, transient ingestion failure and bad SLA data.'],
